1. 实测记录 — data/segments-data.js, data/segments-data.json
   Source: ip-api.com free endpoint (https://ip-api.com/)
   NOTE: the free endpoint is for non-commercial use only. Commercial use of
   these files requires replacing this source (e.g. IPinfo / MaxMind paid data)
   or rescanning with an offline database (DB-IP / MaxMind GeoLite2).

2. IP 归属表（IPv4 → ASN） — data/global-pack.bin
   Source: iptoasn.com (https://iptoasn.com/) — public domain data.

3. ASN 运营类型 — data/global-asn.js（类型字段）
   Source: PeeringDB info_type (https://www.peeringdb.com/) — CC BY 4.0.

4. 机房 / VPN ASN 名单
   Source: bad-asn-list (https://github.com/ipapi-is/ipapi)

5. 城市数据 — data/city/*.bin
   Source: DB-IP City Lite (https://db-ip.com/) — CC BY 4.0.
   Contains data from DB-IP, licensed under CC BY 4.0. Attribution is required:
   "IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)".

6. 可选联网核验（仅在用户点击时请求，不随本产品分发）
   ipwho.is (https://ipwho.is/), ip-api.com (https://ip-api.com/)

7. 可选实测取证（仅在用户点击时请求，不随本产品分发）
   RDAP: rdap.org and the RIRs; DNS over HTTPS: Cloudflare (https://cloudflare-dns.com/)
   and Google (https://dns.google/); BGP data via Team Cymru (whois.cymru.com) and
   RIPEstat / RIS (https://stat.ripe.net/); host scan data via Shodan InternetDB
   (https://internetdb.shodan.io/).

